  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 - Initial stable release\n\n📝 JSON Serialization Features:\n- PascalCase JSON format (C# naming convention)\n- Full message serialization/deserialization\n- Nested message support\n- Collection support (lists, dictionaries)\n- Enum handling\n- Type-safe conversion\n\n🔧 Usage:\n- ToJson() - Serialize message to JSON\n- FromJson() - Deserialize JSON to message\n- Reflection-based (default mode)\n- Interface-based mode for custom logic\n\n⚡ Performance:\n- Efficient JSON writer/reader\n- Minimal memory allocations\n- Compatible with System.Text.Json\n- AOT-friendly implementation\n\n💡 Use Cases:\n- Debugging and logging\n- Configuration files\n- Interoperability with JSON APIs\n- Human-readable data exchange",
